Rule 1 (The input tensor's dtype should be one of the allowed types for the trace operation to avoid InvalidArgumentError related to allowed 'T' values.)
{x : tensor} |= dtype_(x) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(x) ≠ 1
>>
Rule 2 (The input tensor x must have at least two dimensions to avoid InvalidArgumentError related to dimension requirements.)
{x : tensor} |= ndim(x) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 6 (Complex tensors are valid)
{x : tensor} |= dtype_(x) = 9 ∨ dtype_(x) = 10
>>
Rule 15 (Name parameter should be a string and not empty.)
{name : str} |= name ≠ ""
